# Builder Claude Code pin: the version the local-model builder runs. Your everyday claude is separate
# and keeps updating. A change here triggers a quick re-run of the suite (each case once, chosen model
# only; ruled 2026-11-13). Bump only on purpose, between stages.
#
# Set right before Stage 1 starts (ruled 2026-11-18), to the version the user's everyday claude runs then.
# install-claude-code.sh checks the download against the npm registry's own sha512 for this version,
# so a bump is this one line.
CLAUDE_CODE_VERSION=2.1.311
